# IntraCore: параметры HAL блока из базы STM32CubeMX (db/mcu/IP/*_Modes.xml).
# Порождено tools/hal_import — руками не править. Формат: src/Docs/Description/HalCatalogFormat.md
[Ip]
Name=HSP_Engine
Version=v1_0_Cube

[Parameters]
# имя|подпись|группа|единица|мин|макс|описание
HSP_SysClkConfigRange|System clock config range|System Clock||||The system clock is configured at 12MHz by default and it is better to configure at 96MHz for highest performance.
HSP_SPE_SMART_CLOCKING|SPE Smart Clocking|Generic settings||||Smart Clocking feature for SPE (If enabled, the SPE is not clocked in WFE mode)
SPE|SPE|Generic settings||||
HSP_MMC_SMART_CLOCKING|MMC Smart Clocking|Generic settings||||Smart Clocking feature for MMC(If enabled the Memory is not clocked if no access)
MMC|MMC|Generic settings||||
HSP_Controller_SMART_CLOCKING|Controller Smart Clocking|Generic settings||||Smart Clocking feature for CTRL(If enabled the parts of HSP CTRL block are not clocked if inactive)
CTRL|CTRL|Generic settings||||
HSP_LockRegisters|Lock configuration|Generic settings||||Lock the HSP configuration.
DirectLib|Direct library|Modules||||Direct_lib for Direct Command API to run Processing Functions.
DspLib|DSP library|Modules||||Dsp_lib for DSP API (CMSIS ARM like) using HSP capabilities.
CNNLib|CNN library|Modules||||CNN_lib for Convolution using HSP capabilities.
HSP_DEVICE_CROM_VERSION|HSP Device CROM version|Generic settings||||Reference the CROM version embedded by the HSP (Needed to load the right HSP FW RAM).
GUI_HSP_DEVICE_CROM_VERSION|HSP Device CROM version|Generic settings||||Reference the CROM version embedded by the HSP (Needed to load the right HSP FW RAM).
HSP_FW_CRAM_TO_LOAD_VERSION|HSP Firmware CRAM version|Generic settings||||Reference the CRAM version to load.
ENABLE_HSP_PERFORMANCE_MONITOR|Performance Monitor|Generic settings||||Enable the HSP Performance Monitor at boot step (0U to disable, 1U to enable)
USE_HSP_ACC_DIRECT_COMMAND_SYNCHRONOUS|Accelerator Direct Command Synchronous Mode|Generic settings||||Enable the Synchronous mode of Direct Command APIs (0U to disable, 1U to enable)
HSP_BRAM_AI_SIZE|BRAM region size for AI|Generic settings|word|0|4096|Define the BRAM Size in word reserved for CubeAI processing. The maximum value of this flag is dependent on the size of the created buffers.
HSP_BRAM_AI_SIZE_bytes|BRAM region size for AI in bytes|Generic settings||0|16384|Define the BRAM Size in bytes reserved for CubeAI processing. The maximum value of this flag is dependent on the size of the created buffers.
USE_HSP_BRAM_ACCESS_ARBITRATION|BRAM Access Arbitration|Generic settings||||HAL HSP BRAM Bandwidth Arbitration
SMART_CLOCK_GATING|Smart Clock Gating|HSP Boot Parameters||||
REGISTERS_LOCK|Registers Lock|HSP Boot Parameters||||
DIRECT_COMMAND_EVENT_ENABLE|Direct Command Event Enable|HSP Boot Parameters||||
TCU1_ENABLE|Task Comparator 1|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||||Enable the Task Comparator 1
TCU1_VALUE|Task Value 1|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||0|62|Define which task shall be detected by TCU 1
TCU2_ENABLE|Task Comparator 2|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||||Enable the Task Comparator 2
TCU2_VALUE|Task Value 2|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||0|62|Define which task shall be detected by TCU 2
TCU3_ENABLE|Task Comparator 3|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||||Enable the Task Comparator 3
TCU3_VALUE|Task Value 1|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||0|62|Define which task shall be detected by TCU 3
TCU4_ENABLE|Task Comparator 4|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||||Enable the Task Comparator 4
TCU4_VALUE|Task Value 4|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||0|62|Define which task shall be detected by TCU 4
TCU_OVERLAP_DETECTION|Task Overlap Detection|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||||Enable the Task Overlap Detection
TCU_LOWER_TASK_ID|Lower Task ID|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||0|62|Define the Lower Task ID
TCU_HIGHER_TASK_ID|Higher Task ID|Task Comparator Unit (TCU)||0|62|Define the Higher Task ID
